    "scenesThatPass": [
      "JOANNA: I understand, but the ad said the Mac was gonna save the world, it didn’t say it was gonna say hello.\nANDREA: We’re gonna open the house in five.",
      "CHRISANN: Good to see you.\nJOANNA: Nice to see you. Hello, Lisa. We’ve met before and you told me you liked the way I talked and that was my favorite thing anyone’s ever said …\nLISA: You’re from Poland.\nJOANNA: Yes I am. Do you know where that is?",
      "JOANNA: Come. Let’s make that computer say hi.\nCHRISANN: Go ahead, Lisa.\nLISA: So it was the other way around--I was named after the computer?",
      "JOANNA: Come on, hon.\nCHRISANN: What’s the matter with you?!",
      "LISA: Can you teach me more things?\nLISA: On the computer?\nCHRISANN: Lisa, wait for me in the hall please.\nCHRISANN: You can put on your coat in the hall."
    ]
